    <heading>lp5: The Program</heading>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>The program separates reusable UI <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/template">templates</a> from the JavaScript units that own data, presentation, and command handling. A template can keep its markup, styles, and event wiring together without deciding which commands are legal in the current operation.</p>
    </section>
</template>
